    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="3" corresp="#wit-h">Gif cyning æt mannes ham drincæþ, ⁊ ðær man lyswæs hwæt gedo, twibote gebete.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#oliver" n="9" corresp="#wit-h">Gif cyning mannes ham drincæþ ⁊ ðær man lyswæs hwæt gedo, twibote gebete.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#oliver">If the king drinks at a person’s home, and a person should do anything seriously dishonest there, let him pay two[-fold] restitution.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough">If the king is feasting at anyone’s house, and any sort of offence is committed there, twofold compensation shall be paid.</ab>
      </div>
